        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The plans show the room layouts for training sessions for up to ten people and more than ten people. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SL5qdCABPoylICx74wel5rG6gxf\">The plans show the room layouts for training sessions for up to ten people and more than ten people. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</div>\n</div>",
        "sort": 1,
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Two plans for training sessions</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải </strong><strong>th&iacute;ch </strong><strong>đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">Đề b&agrave;i y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về c&aacute;ch bố tr&iacute; ph&ograve;ng cho c&aacute;c buổi đ&agrave;o tạo với tối đa mười người v&agrave; với hơn mười người.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-K5pSdLrQpoF8acxi6Wrln1gigeg\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề&nbsp; với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: c&aacute;ch bố tr&iacute; ph&ograve;ng - c&aacute;c buổi đ&agrave;o tạo - với tối đa mười người v&agrave; với hơn mười người</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVebdDKPDoNbSExDutel4LdQgeo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BVeFdLujWon2cIxTpmRl2ZVLgsd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề Maps, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về những thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BVeFdLujWon2cIxTpmRl2ZVLgsd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TncsdhtbeoT8iixqA7Ul7xN1gZd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nhận định tổng quan:</strong> Nh&igrave;n chung l&agrave; <strong>c&oacute; nhiều sự kh&aacute;c biệt </strong>trong hai plan</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QOSCd3Gmtos6IlxVNzxl2GKWgzg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Những thay đổi nổi bật nhất:</strong> Sự kh&aacute;c biệt cốt l&otilde;i nhất nằm ở số lượng chỗ ngồi, vị tr&iacute; của bục giảng v&agrave; bảng trắng.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch m&ocirc; tả c&aacute;c đặc điểm khu vực<strong> dựa tr&ecirc;n khu vực:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfFWd7rzNoOfyax6As5l5WbjgPb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DA9Wd4PctodTUwxgjellSqICgId\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> M&ocirc; tả c&aacute;ch sắp xếp vị tr&iacute; của lối v&agrave;o, bảng trắng v&agrave; bục giảng ở cả hai plan</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AxqBdKX8goAxRZxZ9jglIUQpg7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> X&eacute;t chi tiết hơn về bố cục, cả hai sơ đồ đều <em>c&oacute; lối v&agrave;o giống hệt nhau</em> <strong>(share an idential entrance)</strong> <em>ở g&oacute;c tr&ecirc;n b&ecirc;n phải</em> <strong>(the top-right corner).</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jq6vdjr4to2FY3xpYV3lRq0HgCf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Trong sơ đồ A, một bảng trắng được đặt <em>dọc theo bức tường ph&iacute;a trước</em><strong> (run along the front wall)</strong>, v&agrave; bục ph&aacute;t biểu nằm ở g&oacute;c tr&ecirc;n b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L2qOd37GjoPzaIx3udslTRm6gCc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 3:</strong> Ngược lại, sơ đồ B c&oacute; một bục nhỏ hơn <em>được đặt ở giữa ph&ograve;ng</em> <strong>(centrally placed in the room)</strong>, với một bảng trắng ngay ph&iacute;a sau bục.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OjaWdSEbmoJoAGxVobNlgCBAgbf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 4: </strong>Về khu vực phục vụ tr&agrave; s&aacute;ng, trong sơ đồ A, khu vực n&agrave;y nằm ở cuối ph&ograve;ng, trong khi ở sơ đồ B, một khu vực tr&agrave; s&aacute;ng <em>h&igrave;nh chữ L</em> <strong>(an L-shaped one)</strong> <em>được bố tr&iacute; ở g&oacute;c trước b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i </em><strong>(occupy the front-left corner).</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXVUdjVVKo0SA1xuZW1l8Varggb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: M&ocirc; tả c&aacute;ch sắp xếp vị tr&iacute; của khu vực tr&agrave; s&aacute;ng v&agrave; c&aacute;ch bố tr&iacute; chỗ ngồi ở cả hai plan</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXVUdjVVKo0SA1xuZW1l8Varggb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYe4dXTekoIKoqxyksol8ECdgi2\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Về c&aacute;ch sắp xếp chỗ ngồi, cả hai sơ đồ đều c&oacute; ba b&agrave;n ri&ecirc;ng biệt d&agrave;nh cho <em>học vi&ecirc;n</em> <strong>(trainees)</strong>, <em>được xếp th&agrave;nh h&igrave;nh chữ U</em> <strong>(be arranged in a U-shaped formation)</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S2GwdBMONoVHVNxiJM0lTXLKgod\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, trong sơ đồ A, mỗi b&agrave;n c&oacute; ba gh&ecirc; <em>quay mặt v&agrave;o b&ecirc;n trong</em> <strong>(face inwards)</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TewFdBLZioRrjexng2Kl29gsgse\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 3:</strong> Ngược lại, sơ đồ B c&oacute; thể <em>chứa được</em> <strong>(accommodate)</strong> nhiều người hơn, với mỗi b&agrave;n c&oacute; s&aacute;u chỗ ngồi &ndash; ba người ở mỗi b&ecirc;n, <em>ngồi đối diện nhau</em> <strong>(face one another)</strong>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Paraphrasing &amp; Vocabulary:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A71AdW2Ulob03txc81glg8CIgMc\">Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng ta sẽ cần paraphrase c&aacute;c cụm từ sau nhiều lần:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UTC9dUWuqoAZttx5RCDl3yZggGg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Tổ chức c&aacute;c buổi training: </strong>tổ chức c&aacute;c buổi đ&agrave;o tạo</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HjEsdkJUvoO7I5xJdRGl9Liag8g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Người tham gia/ học vi&ecirc;n:</strong> participant, trainee</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JI4pdDysqoitrix7oUTlDBSzgeb\">C&aacute;c bạn c&oacute; thể ghi ch&uacute; một v&agrave;i từ c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng để m&ocirc; tả về vị tr&iacute; v&agrave; c&aacute;c sắp xếp nha:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WRG5dO4mloDhU0xehKYlPiIJgMg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>run along the wall: </strong>dọc bức tường</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PsSgdy4AwooVCZx8oXilRoesghh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>be positioned + prep ...: </strong>được đặt ở đ&acirc;u đ&oacute;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TzsmdKKQuo2davxM4N5lOuOJg1f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>be centrally placed + prep ...: </strong>được đặt ở giữa ở đ&acirc;u đ&oacute;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UKZkdgKhJoIxddxWg5Mlt8WsgvE\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>be directly behind ...: </strong>được ngay ở ph&iacute;a sau ...</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LRe1du6ElojKFWxVDaolbsIVgXe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>occupy the ....: </strong>chiếm một khu vực n&agrave;o đ&oacute;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I0lzdpcHUoXzr0xu6cPlq0Tygsc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>be arranged in .... formation: </strong>được sắp xếp theo dạng thức n&agrave;o đ&oacute;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B9HwdEZEAolS80xo5kvlg0O5gWn\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>face inwards: </strong>hướng v&agrave;o trong</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WFJ5dqohPo9uYCxCic1ltb3lgUe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>face one another: </strong>hướng v&agrave;o nhau</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2411,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GAh0dD0YkoDeDFxzg8flLjg2gUg\">The plans depict two different layouts that can be used to <strong>host</strong><strong> training </strong><strong>sessions</strong>, namely plan A for a maximum of ten <strong>participants</strong> and plan B for more than ten people.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 19783,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2412,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QszjdVhG8oIQKFxnWmgl6R3DgOd\">Overall, both plans feature the same key facilities, with the main differences being the number of seats, the location of the podium and the whiteboard.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 19783,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2413,
